### FacturaPro — end-to-end flow
### Run the requests in order with the ▶ icon next to each one.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register a user (public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo123",
  "enabled": true,
  "razon_social": "Demo SAC",
  "ruc": "20123456789",
  "direccion": "Av. Demo 123",
  "email": "demo@example.com"
}

### 2. Assign a role (public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rol": "ADMIN",
  "user": { "id": 1 }
}

### 3. Log in — stores the token automatically
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.jwttoken); %}

### 4. Create a bank
POST {{baseUrl}}/bancos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Banco Demo",
  "codigo": "BD01",
  "ruc": "20987654321"
}

### 5. Register the USD exchange rate
POST {{baseUrl}}/dolar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor_dolar": 3.75,
  "fecha_registro": "2024-11-15"
}

### 6. Create a debtor
POST {{baseUrl}}/deudores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ruc": "20555555555",
  "razon_social": "Cliente Demo SAC",
  "direccion": "Jr. Cliente 456",
  "telefono": "999888777",
  "email": "cliente@example.com"
}

### 7. Create a portfolio (user is taken from the token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cartera
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bancos": { "id": 1 },
  "fecha_descuento": "2024-11-15",
  "moneda": "PEN",
  "estado": "Activo"
}

### 8. Add an invoice to the portfolio
POST {{baseUrl}}/documentos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartera": { "id": 1 },
  "deudor": { "id": 1 },
  "tipo": "Factura",
  "numero_documento": "F001-0001",
  "valor_nominal": 10000,
  "fecha_emision": "2024-11-15",
  "fecha_vencimiento": "2025-02-13",
  "moneda": "PEN",
  "valor_tasa": 12,
  "tipo_tasa": "Efectiva",
  "dias_tasa": "360",
  "periodo_capitalizacion": "Diaria",
  "tasa_efectiva_calculada": 12,
  "tipo_tasa_efectiva": "TEA",
  "portes": 10,
  "comision_estudios": 20,
  "comision_desembolso": 15,
  "comision_cobranza": 10,
  "igv": 9.9,
  "dias_descuento": 90,
  "tasa_descuento": 2.79,
  "valor_neto": 0,
  "intereses_calculados": 0,
  "estado": "Pendiente"
}

### 9. Recalculate the portfolio
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cartera/calculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Read the results (total_valor_neto, tcea)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cartera/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Without a token — should return 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/cartera/1
